<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Image src="assets/banner.jpg" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 60, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 15, left: 60, width: 820, fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>AFM：给环境特征学一个门控</Text>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 23, left: 900, width: 100, fontSize: 15, color: '#BBD9F2', textAlign: 'right' }}>02 · 所提方法</Text>
    <Image src="assets/logo_bar.png" style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 8, left: 1010, width: 210, height: 44, objectFit: 'contain' }} />

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 72, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 616, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 22 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 540, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src="assets/fig04.png" style={{ width: 520, height: 225 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    图 4　自适应特征融合模块（AFM）。环境特征先经 3×3 卷积与 Softmax 生成权重矩阵，加权后再与观测特征拼接融合。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ background: '#E8F0FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #123C6E', padding: '14px 18px', marginTop: 22 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        门控在问一个问题：这个位置的环境线索，值不值得信？
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 44 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                    <Math latex="F^{s}=\\mathrm{AFM}\\left(F_o^{s},\\,F_e^{s}\\right)" width={300} display={true} color="#123C6E" />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>式 (3)</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    <Math latex="F_e^{\\prime}=W\\otimes F_e" width={190} display={true} color="#123C6E" />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>式 (4)</Text>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 26 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 44 }}>①</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 470 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>生成门控</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                            环境特征 F_e 过 3×3 卷积 + Softmax，得到与特征同形状的权重矩阵 W。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 20 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 44 }}>②</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 470 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>加权环境特征</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                            W 与 F_e 逐元素相乘，抑制与当前观测无关的建筑纹理。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 20 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E5A9E', width: 44 }}>③</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 470 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>拼接融合</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                            加权特征与观测特征 concat，经 3×3 卷积输出该 stage 的融合特征。
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
